frontend/dist/

# Downloaded EEG recordings (~6.6 GB) — fetch with tools/fetch_*.py
#
# Root-anchored. An unanchored `data/` matches a directory of that name at any
# depth, which silently swallowed frontend/src/data — the page built locally
# off untracked files and would have failed on a fresh clone.
# Contents, not the directory itself: git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a `!` negation under `/data/` can never re-include anything.
/data/*
# The catalogue is 392 KB of metadata rather than recordings, and is the
# artifact CATALOGUE.md quotes and any fetch decision is made from.
!/data/catalogue/
